graph TD
    A[Replication Fork] --> B[DnaB Helicase]
    B --> C[DNA Unwinding]
    C --> D[Single-Stranded DNA Regions]
    D --> E{Strand Type?}
    
    E -->|Leading Strand| F[Continuous Synthesis Template]
    E -->|Lagging Strand| G[Discontinuous Synthesis Template]
    
    %% Leading Strand Pathway
    F --> H[DNA Pol III Core Enzyme α]
    H --> I[3'-OH Primer Terminus]
    I --> J{dNTP Available?}
    J -->|Yes| K[Nucleotide Selection]
    J -->|No| L[Synthesis Paused]
    
    K --> M[Watson-Crick Base Pairing]
    M --> N[Phosphodiester Bond Formation]
    N --> O[Pyrophosphate Release]
    O --> P[DNA Extension +1 Nucleotide]
    P --> Q{Proofreading Check?}
    
    Q -->|Correct Base| R[Continue Synthesis]
    Q -->|Mismatch| S[3'-5' Exonuclease ε Subunit]
    S --> T[Excise Incorrect Nucleotide]
    T --> K
    
    R --> U[Beta Clamp Processivity]
    U --> V[Tau Clamp Loader]
    V --> W[Maintain Association]
    W --> X{End of Template?}
    X -->|No| K
    X -->|Yes| Y[Leading Strand Complete]
    
    %% Lagging Strand Pathway
    G --> Z[SSB Coating ssDNA]
    Z --> AA[DnaG Primase Recognition]
    AA --> AB[RNA Primer Synthesis]
    AB --> AC[~10 nt RNA Primer]
    AC --> AD[DNA Pol III Recognition]
    
    AD --> AE{Okazaki Fragment Synthesis?}
    AE -->|Initiate| AF[DNA Pol III Core Enzyme α]
    AF --> AG[Extension from RNA Primer]
    AG --> AH[dNTP Incorporation]
    AH --> AI[Synthesis ~1000-2000 nt]
    
    AI --> AJ{Reach Previous Fragment?}
    AJ -->|No| AH
    AJ -->|Yes| AK[Pol III Dissociates]
    
    AK --> AL[DNA Pol I Recognition]
    AL --> AM[5'-3' Exonuclease Activity]
    AM --> AN[Nick Translation]
    AN --> AO[Remove RNA Primer]
    AO --> AP[Replace with DNA]
    
    AP --> AQ{Nick Remaining?}
    AQ -->|Yes| AR[DNA Ligase]
    AR --> AS[Seal Phosphodiester Backbone]
    AS --> AT[Completed Okazaki Fragment]
    
    %% Coordination and Regulation
    AT --> AU{New Primer Needed?}
    AU -->|Yes| AA
    AU -->|No| AV[Lagging Strand Complete]
    
    B --> AW{Helicase-Primase Coordination?}
    AW -->|Signal| AA
    
    U --> AX{Leading-Lagging Coupling?}
    V --> AX
    AX -->|Coordinated| AY[Replisome Integrity]
    
    AY --> AZ{Continue Replication?}
    L --> AZ
    AZ -->|Fork Active| BA[Processive Synthesis]
    AZ -->|Fork Stalled| BB[Checkpoint Activation]
    
    BA --> BC{Obstacles?}
    BC -->|Lesions| BD[Lesion Bypass Pathways]
    BC -->|Proteins| BE[Fork Remodeling]
    BC -->|None| K
    
    BD --> BF[TLS Polymerases]
    BE --> BG[Recombination Pathways]
    
    Y --> BH{Both Strands Complete?}
    AV --> BH
    BH -->|Yes| BI[Replicated DNA Duplex]
    BH -->|No| BA
    
    BI --> BJ[Topoisomerase Resolution]
    BJ --> BK(\1)
    BK --> BL[Sister Chromosome Separation]
    

